                                                "example_id": "fd8e856f-2ad7-4317-8549-41ed253fe4af",
                                                "sense_id": "db611c69-24e3-3948-a3f0-21570d26ee4b",
                                                "text": "In the UK, the highest social grade is A – upper middle class."
